{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Deer Named Banyan: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja12'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 12 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sīlavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ethics </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>2. Nigrodhamigajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Deer Named Banyan: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nigrodhameva seveyya, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Befriend only Banyan, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>na sākhamupasaṁvase; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>stay away from Branch. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nigrodhasmiṁ mataṁ seyyo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Better is death with Banyan </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yañce sākhasmi jīvitan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>than life with Branch. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Nigrodhamigajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
